OL,3,AIran offers US deal to reopen Strait of
OL,4,AHormuz in seven days
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked about the Iranian offer, a US
OL,7,Fofficial told the BBC positive
OL,8,Fdiscussions were taking place through
OL,9,Fmediators, including about nuclear
OL,10,Fissues.
